  "description": "A time when tyrants ruled. A prophecy has reached the country. A child born on the day of prophecy will bring great prosperity to the country. But the child can go crazy with slaughter and ruin the country. In order to prevent this, you have to live a full life. On that day of prophecy, the Crown Prince 'Tae-Ho' was born. \n\nThe story of 'Tae-Ho', the child of prophecy, and 'Hae-Su' who appeared before him. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
